Package: NicoSIMD
Type: Package
Title: NicoSIMD: AVX2, AVX-512 and NEON Math, Fused Log Densities and Fused Functions for Stan Models
Version: 0.1.9000
Date: 2026-10-16
Author: Enzo Cerullo
Maintainer: Enzo Cerullo <enzo.cerullo@bath.edu>
Description: Header-only C++ (AVX2, AVX-512, and NEON through SIMDe) versions of the elementwise math, log densities and general functions of Stan models, called from Stan as external nico_ functions; used by NicoStan and BayesMVP when installed.
License: GPL-3
Imports: utils
SystemRequirements: GNU make, C++17, an x86-64 CPU with AVX2 (AVX-512 where the CPU has it)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
